You are a Senior Frontend Engineer and UI/UX Designer.

Build a lightweight Enterprise Resource Portfolio Dashboard.

====================================================
Technology
====================================================

Use ONLY

- HTML5
- CSS3
- Vanilla JavaScript
- Chart.js
- SheetJS (xlsx)

No React
No Angular
No Backend
No Database
No AI
No Authentication
No Notifications
No Email

Everything should run locally by opening index.html.

====================================================
Goal
====================================================

Managers currently maintain project and resource allocation in Excel.

The dashboard should convert Excel into a clean, professional management dashboard.

The dashboard should NOT try to replace Excel.

It should simply help managers quickly understand the current project portfolio.

Keep the UI minimal, clean and uncluttered.

====================================================
