====================================================
Normalization
====================================================

Do NOT work directly with Excel rows.

Normalize the data into

Projects
Resources
Assignments
Environments

Split comma-separated resource names into individual assignments.

Example

Testing Resources

Rohit, Ram, Jacob

becomes

Trade Hub -> Rohit
Trade Hub -> Ram
Trade Hub -> Jacob

This normalized model will be used for all calculations.

